  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:maran_divishmaya/slave">
        <tei:pb n="24" ed="1912" facs="https://archive.org/download/selichothdavidasher1912/page/n50_medium.jpg"/>
        <tei:p>Lord in heaven! we entreat thee, as a slave entreateth his master. We are oppressed, and dwell in darkness, our souls are afflicted with so much distress. We lack the power to propitiate thee; O Lord! do it for the covenant’s sake, which thou didst enter into with our forefathers. </tei:p>
      </tei:div>
